{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "169c154f-b789-4ede-bc4e-1c8c4e28e637",
    "name": "Payment Labs",
    "description": "Backend simulado de processamento de pagamentos (TCC UNISINOS). Cobre health check, criação assíncrona e consulta de pagamentos, incluindo os casos de validação (400) e não encontrado (404). Rode `npm run lab:up` numa aba e `npm run worker` em outra antes de usar esta collection.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Body reports ok status\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"ok\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Payment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 202\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(202);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Payment is accepted as PENDING\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql(\"PENDING\");",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a(\"string\");",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"paymentId\", body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": \"10.00\",\n  \"currency\": \"BRL\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            },
            "description": "Cria um pagamento. O processamento é assíncrono: a resposta vem como PENDING (202 Accepted) e um worker separado, consumindo a fila payments.process, atualiza o status para APPROVED pouco depois. O `id` retornado é salvo em `paymentId` para as próximas requisições — rode 'Get Payment' de novo após um instante para ver o status já como APPROVED."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Payment - Invalid Amount",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 400\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Error message mentions amount\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include(\"amount\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": \"not-a-number\",\n  \"currency\": \"BRL\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            },
            "description": "amount precisa ser uma string decimal positiva com até 2 casas (ex. \"10.00\"). Espera 400."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Payment - Invalid Currency",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 400\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Error message mentions currency\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include(\"currency\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": \"10.00\",\n  \"currency\": \"brl\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments"]
            },
            "description": "currency precisa ser um código ISO 4217 de 3 letras maiúsculas (ex. \"BRL\"). Espera 400."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Returned payment matches paymentId\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"paymentId\"));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "{{paymentId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Roda a request \"Create Payment\" antes desta, para popular a variável {{paymentId}}."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payment - Not Found",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 404\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
            },
            "description": "UUID bem formado, mas inexistente no banco. Espera 404."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Payment - Invalid Id Format",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 400\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/not-a-uuid",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["payments", "not-a-uuid"]
            },
            "description": "id que não é um UUID válido. Espera 400."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
